                "REG-119-BLOCKING-UNIQUE-CONSTRAINT-BUILD: ALTER TABLE ... ADD CONSTRAINT ... UNIQUE executed without CREATE UNIQUE INDEX CONCURRENTLY + USING INDEX, blocking table writes."
