                "REG-138-PG18-EAGER-FREEZE-RATE-OUT-OF-BOUNDS: vacuum_max_eager_freeze_failure_rate must be bounded in [0.01, 0.10] (default 0.03); 0 disables eager freezing and >0.20 saturates OLTP I/O on contended pages."
